    tldr: "Physician who runs the Cancer Diseases Hospital in Lusaka, Zambia's national cancer treatment hospital, as its Senior Medical Superintendent.",
    summary: "Dr Susan C. Msadabwe is Senior Medical Superintendent of the Cancer Diseases Hospital (CDH) in Lusaka, the Zambian public cancer hospital on the University Teaching Hospital campus at Nationalist Road. The hospital's website presents her welcome message in its 'Who We Are' section, describing a team committed to patient care, research and wellness initiatives and a customer service charter for patients. The website gives no further biographical detail.",
    profiles: [{ label: "Cancer Diseases Hospital website", url: "https://www.cdh.gov.zm/" }, { label: "PubMed", url: "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=Msadabwe+S%5BAuthor%5D" }],
